            "value": "Prefix + date_original_sequence (selected components only) + suffix. Missing capture dates use undated. Invalid characters / \\ : * ? \" < > | and control characters become _; leading / trailing spaces and dots are removed. Names may use up to 240 UTF-8 bytes including the extension. Conflicts prevent export."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前缀 + 日期_原名_序号（仅所选部分）+ 后缀。缺失拍摄日期用 undated；非法字符 / \\ : * ? \" < > | 和控制字符替换为 _，去掉首尾空格和点。含扩展名最多 240 UTF-8 字节，重名会阻止导出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
